<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<catalogue id="23b314a3-e386-5656-abb1-b7494314547f" name="Railroad" revision="1" battleScribeVersion="2.03" authorName="Personal use" gameSystemId="e8ea97a4-676b-55f2-a1df-54b8b97e97aa" gameSystemRevision="1" library="false" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema">
  <readme>Source: Fallout: Factions core / Battle for Boston faction guide assembly guide supplied by the user. Ratings shown = model + weapon set.</readme>
  <selectionEntries>
    <selectionEntry id="d87a295f-ee76-503c-a695-c1fe98d602b8" name="Crew Rules and Ploys" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true" id="3e40e506-e0b0-58fc-8e56-fc89b14ab9c2"/></constraints>
      <rules>
        <rule id="4fca4157-3361-5110-a89c-084f9f04bfa7" name="Crew Limits" hidden="false"><description>Upgrade Limit per model: T1 4 / T2 6 / T3 8; Champion Limit: T1 3 / T2 4 / T3 5; Total Control Limit: T1 5 / T2 10 / T3 15; Starting Ploy Tokens: T1 0 / T2 1 / T3 2</description></rule>
        <rule id="f39170b9-fc24-5bed-a1f3-c3fc41f404bf" name="Ploy: Railroad Ploy Tokens" hidden="false"><description>Start with Ploy Tokens by Tier; gain another each time your crew Incapacitates an Enemy. Railroad Ploys ignore normal usage limits but each can only be used once per Round. Standard/other-source Ploys cost 3 tokens and once per game. Place an Insurgency Token (30mm base) after both crews Deploy; Runners (Scout) count as extra Insurgency Tokens.</description></rule>
        <rule id="f9e1c74c-ec09-5c3c-8caa-2162545943ee" name="Ploy: Boobytrap" hidden="false"><description>When an Enemy model ends movement within 3" of a Search Token: your Leader makes an attack with the Boobytrap weapon against every model (either crew) within 3" of the token; no Bonus Dice.</description></rule>
        <rule id="87644bf3-51d8-5ee4-8692-99dc889b9d75" name="Ploy: Infiltration" hidden="false"><description>After selecting an Active model within 3" of an Insurgency Token, before Actions: move it into Base contact with a different Insurgency Token; it takes 1 Fatigue.</description></rule>
        <rule id="491fabeb-60e0-5809-afdb-8c7ebfbdf3a6" name="Ploy: Shock Assault" hidden="false"><description>When a Friendly model completes Get Moving: all Enemy models within 3" not Engaged with it suffer 1 Harm (Excess Harm causes no Injury).</description></rule>
        <rule id="2f8bbbe9-366d-592b-aeb9-6a3a9889ad12" name="Ploy: Tripwire" hidden="false"><description>When an Enemy model moves through, to or from a point on a straight line between two Insurgency Tokens: movement stops there and it suffers 1 Harm and 1 Fatigue.</description></rule>
        <rule id="48db10dd-8a71-5854-a376-baeb8587c071" name="Ploy: Concealed Snipers" hidden="false"><description>When a Friendly model Open Fires with an Aim weapon: draw Line of Sight and range from an Insurgency Token instead of the model. This is an attack.</description></rule>
      </rules>
      <costs><cost name="Rating" typeId="682660dc-9396-5ac8-a4c4-fd893fab78f0" value="0.0"/></costs>
    </selectionEntry>
